  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta \\mathrm{H}-\\Delta \\mathrm{U} & =\\Delta \\mathrm{n}_g \\mathrm{RT} \\\\\n& =-\\frac{1}{2} \\times 8.314 \\times 298 \\\\\n& =-1238.78\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
